# Let's Play a Game: delirium counts only "cards in your graveyard" (CR 207.2c, 700.2). On turn 1 Black Lotus pays for a Wheel of
# Fortune: Bot1's graveyard gets the Lotus (artifact), the Wheel (sorcery) and five Islands (land), three types. Bot2's graveyard gets
# a Memnite (creature), a Lightning Bolt (instant) and five Islands (land), which would make five types between them but do not
# count. On turn 3 only one mode may be chosen: choosing two is refused, and "each opponent discards two cards" alone takes Bot2
# from seven cards (seven drawn off the Wheel and one for turn 2, less one discarded to hand size at that cleanup) to five.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Wheel of Fortune
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Let's Play a Game
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
Island x5
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Wheel of Fortune.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Let's Play a Game.Cast
! Bot1.Modes(1; 2)
Bot1.Modes(2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

